  "body": "Hi, i am new with matrix. I setup success my server and a riot web/android client.\r\nI would like to use Matrix as a chat in my community of 100,000 members.\r\n\r\nTo protect users from spam, I have different user levels in my community. \r\n\r\nI want to prevent users from writing to hundreds of others one after the other, or posting wild messages in the main room.\r\n\r\nCan I restrict users?\r\n\r\nallow me to enter a room but not write messages in it? (with its own field message regarding the user level)\r\n\r\nallow me to enter a room but not open private chats?  \r\n\r\nOnly if another user with the permission to open a private chat should this user be able to answer. etc etc. \r\n\r\nbest regards",
